{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18066","headline":"射训狐 · 韩愈","name":"射训狐","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"有鸟夜飞名训狐，矜凶挟狡夸自呼。\n乘时阴黑止我屋，声势慷慨非常麤。\n安然大唤谁畏忌，造作百怪非无须。\n聚鬼徵妖自朋扇，摆掉栱桷颓塈涂。\n慈母抱儿怕入席，那暇更护鸡窠雏。\n我念乾坤德泰大，卵此恶物常勤劬。\n纵之岂即遽有害，斗柄行拄西南隅。\n谁谓停奸计尤剧，意欲唐突羲和乌。\n侵更历漏气弥厉，何由侥幸休须臾。\n咨余往射岂得已，候女两眼张睢盱。\n枭惊堕梁蛇走窦，一夫斩颈羣雏枯。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩愈","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18066.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18066","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}